# Repository-root ignore rules.
#
# Vercel reads .vercelignore from the deploy root, and this project's Root
# Directory is unset, so it deploys the whole repository — these are the rules
# that actually apply.
#
# Deliberately no re-inclusion patterns. An earlier version excluded
# landing/assets/* and re-included subdirectories with "!", which relies on
# the ignore implementation honouring negation after a wildcard; the logo
# never reached the deploy. Everything publishable now lives under
# landing/assets/ and everything excluded lives outside it, so these are
# plain excludes with nothing to get wrong.
#
# landing/_captures/ holds the raw admin screenshots kept as source material.
# They show real candidate names and email addresses, and a static host serves
# anything inside the deployed directory, so they must never ship.

landing/_captures/
landing/reference/
landing/DESIGN.md
landing/PROVENANCE.md
landing/build-standalone.py
landing/standalone.html
